<section class="hero" id="inicio">
 <div class="hero-inner">
  <div class="hero-content">
   <div class="section-label anim anim-d1">Reservas online para tu complejo deportivo</div>
   <h1 class="anim anim-d2">Tus clientes reservan y pagan solos.<br><em>Vos cobrás sin mover un dedo.</em></h1>
   <p class="hero-subtitle anim anim-d3">Cancha, horario, seña con MercadoPago, todo desde el celular de tu cliente. Vos recibís la plata, gestionás desde el panel. Sin WhatsApp, sin Excel, sin llamadas.</p>
   <div class="hero-ctas anim anim-d4">
    <a class="btn-primary" href="https://app.vibe.com.ar/register" rel="noopener">Crear mi cuenta<svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg></a>
    <a class="hero-link-secondary" href="#como-funciona">Ver cómo funciona</a>
   </div>
   <div class="hero-proof anim anim-d5">
    <span class="hero-proof-text">Diseñado para complejos de pádel, tenis, fútbol y básquet en <strong>Argentina</strong></span>
   </div>
   <div class="integration-bar anim anim-d5">
    <div class="integration-label">Cobros procesados por</div>
    <div class="mp-logo"><img src="/mercado-pago-logo.svg" alt="MercadoPago" width="160" height="36" loading="lazy"></div>
   </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-visual anim anim-d5">
   <div class="hero-visual-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
   <div class="phone-frame">
    <div class="phone-notch" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="phone-screen">
     <!-- muted + playsinline are what make phones allow autoplay at all, and
          `muted` is repeated as a property because Safari reads the attribute too
          late on a hydrated element. MP4 goes first: H.264 is the one codec every
          phone decodes in hardware, and it's the smaller file here anyway. -->
     <video
      class="phone-video"
      autoplay
      loop
      muted
      playsinline
      webkit-playsinline
      disablepictureinpicture
      preload="auto"
      poster="/video/hero-reserva-poster.jpg"
      aria-label="Un cliente reserva una cancha desde el celular: elige el horario, deja sus datos y paga la seña"
     >
      <source src="/video/hero-reserva.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
      <source src="/video/hero-reserva.webm" type="video/webm" />
     </video>
    </div>
   </div>
  </div>
 </div>
</section>
